[36m(TaskRunner pid=460740)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=460740)[0m it cannot be cancelled. The agent needs to explain the cancellation detail
[36m(TaskRunner pid=460740)[0m and ask for explicit user confirmation (yes/no) to proceed. If the user confirms,
[36m(TaskRunner pid=460740)[0m the order status will be changed to 'cancelled' and the payment will be refunded.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=460740)[0m The refund will be added to the user's gift card balance immediately if the payment
[36m(TaskRunner pid=460740)[0m was made using a gift card, otherwise the refund would take 5-7 business days to process.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=460740)[0m The function returns the order details after the cancellation.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=460740)[0m     - order_id (string, required): The order id, such as '#W0000000'. Be careful there is a '#' symbol at the beginning of the order id.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=460740)[0m     - reason (string, required): The reason for cancellation, which should be either 'no longer needed' or 'ordered by mistake'.
