[36m(TaskRunner pid=1955391)[0m     "snippet": "---\ntitle: Catch-Up with the Cast of 80s Crime Series '21 Jump Street'\u2014See Where the Stars Are Today\ndate: 2024-08-26\n---\nCatch-Up with the Cast of 80s Crime Series '21 Jump Street'\u2014See Where the Stars Are Today\n\nFind out which major movie star made a name for himself on the 80s crime series\n\nCrime dramas as a whole have frequently had a lot in common, including a generally serious tone, central locations where crimes take place in each episode and cops and perps played as adults. One of the first shows to break away from all of that was the 1987 series 21 Jump Street, which followed four younger-looking cops who went undercover in high school where they posed as students to fight crime on that level.\n\nStarring Pirates of the Caribbean actor Johnny Depp, 21 Jump Street put a pretty unique twist on the classic crime drama. Check in with the cast of the series and see where the stars of 21 Jump Street have been since the show came to an end in 1991.\n\nJohnny Depp\n\nCharacter Played: Officer Tom Hanson\n\nBorn: June 9, 1963, in Owensboro, Kentucky\n\nBest Known For: Edward Scissorhands
